D=2(a^e-1)x(phi) nonzero, B_i=sum_u k_i(u) u^e psi(u).
Thus B_i is a nonunit in the local coefficient ring.

At B choose pi with pi^ell=q and mu(j)=tau(pi)/pi. The ratio
s_u r_i / pi^{k_i(u)} is a unit. Its tau-ratio lies in mu_ell
since tau fixes y_i after conjugation (q splits K), and also
