expansions of w0(cg)=w0(gc) give -w0(g)=w0(g), using
w0(c)=0 and chi(c)=-1. Hence 2w0=0, contradiction.
Chebotarev in the nonempty open subset H minus zeroSubgroup(w0)
gives a split Frobenius phi with w0(phi)!=0, contradicting (B).
Therefore the SAME component is killed by 2 X^2, strengthening
the native 4 X^2 by factor 2. Keep factor 2 for visibility:
it cannot be dropped from this general cocycle argument at ell=2.
For ell odd, 2 is a unit; for ell>N+e+3 choose instead CRT
